<!-- 
  GUEST CHECK-IN PAGE
  This page allows receptionists to check in guests and assign them to available rooms.
  
  BACKEND TODO:
  - Pass availableRooms array with room numbers and types from controller
  - Handle POST request from check-in form to create new guest entry
  - Validate all form fields before submission
  - Assign selected room to guest and update room status to 'Occupied'
  - Create guest record in guests.json with all form data
  - Redirect to dashboard or show success message after check-in
  
  FORM FIELDS:
  - firstName: Guest's first name
  - lastName: Guest's last name
  - email: Guest's email address
  - phone: Guest's phone number
  - idNumber: Guest's ID/passport number
  - checkInDate: Check-in date
  - checkOutDate: Expected check-out date
  - roomSelect: Selected room number (dropdown populated from availableRooms)
-->

